### 1. Login AppRole (espera 200 y un client_token)
POST {{vault}}/v1/auth/approle/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role_id": "{{role_id}}", "secret_id": "{{secret_id}}" }

> {% client.global.set("vault_token", response.body.auth.client_token); %}

### 2. Leer el secreto permitido (espera 200)
GET {{vault}}/v1/secret/data/stockea/idp
X-Vault-Token: {{vault_token}}

### 3. Leer una ruta NO permitida (espera 403)
GET {{vault}}/v1/secret/data/stockea/otra-cosa
X-Vault-Token: {{vault_token}}

### 4. Login con un SecretId incorrecto (espera un error 4xx)
POST {{vault}}/v1/auth/approle/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role_id": "{{role_id}}", "secret_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }